;   Spell slot 27's init vector.
;
;   The dispatcher at slot 0 $8F39 is:
;
;       ldy $8F81,x
;       sty $13
;       ldy $8FAB,x
;       sty $14
;       jmp ($0013)
;
;   $8F81 and $8FAB are the low and high tables, 42 bytes each (40 spells
;   plus the empty and unknown sentinels). Index $1B is slot 27. Measured
;   on the rebuilt image before this overlay: low $8F9C held $12 and high
;   $8FC6 held $91, so the vector was $9112, a single `rts`. The bytes on
;   either side of index $1B are left alone (index $1A stays $9111, another
;   rts; index $1C stays $912E, featherlite).
;
;   The two bytes below are the address of `obinspect`. They are literals
;   because the two tables are not contiguous and this module cannot see a
;   forward symbol as a relocation; test_spell_slot.py reads `obinspect` back
;   out of the image and fails if these bytes are not that address.
;
;   Written by us. Eurocom's source is read-only and pinned; see README.md.

        org $8f9c
sp27lo  db $47
        org $8fc6
sp27hi  db $fb
